        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h1>Thank You</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello Fellow Settlers!  Thank you for the support and love given to my game!   This is my first attempt at Game Development and I have learned alot.  I will be taking this knowledge and using it on my next big project.  I hope you enjoyed Lysoria: The Settler's Path.  Have a great day!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to build, manage, and expand your settlement in Lysoria: The Settlers Path. As the leader, you’ll guide your people through challenges, resource management, and strategic decisions to transform a humble village into a thriving kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings, assign workers, and unlock new technologies as you balance growth, prestige, and happiness. With a rich blend of city-building, strategy, and simulation, Lysoria offers a deep and rewarding experience for fans of thoughtful management games. Can you lead your settlers to prosperity and leave a lasting legacy?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to build, manage, and expand your settlement in Lysoria: The Settlers Path. As the leader, you’ll guide your people through challenges, resource management, and strategic decisions to transform a humble village into a thriving kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings, assign workers, and unlock new technologies as you balance growth, prestige, and happiness. With a rich blend of city-building, strategy, and simulation, Lysoria offers a deep and rewarding experience for fans of thoughtful management games. Can you lead your settlers to prosperity and leave a lasting legacy?</p>",
        "short_description": "Shape the destiny of your settlement in Lysoria: The Settlers Path. Build, upgrade, and manage resources as you guide your people through challenges and growth. Unlock new technologies, assign workers, and expand your village into a thriving kingdom in this strategic city-builder.",
